a-xmark"></i></button></div><div id="iosInstallVisual" class="hidden ios-install-visual"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-from-bracket"></i><span>Compartilhar</span><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i><i class="fa-regular fa-square-plus"></i><span>Adicionar à Tela de Início</span></div><p id="installHelp" class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-3"></p><ol id="installSteps" class="mt-3 pl-5 list-decimal text-sm text-slate-500 space-y-2"></ol><button id="retryInstallButton" class="w-full mt-5 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 text-white font-extrabold">Tentar instalar</button><button id="copyInstallLink" class="hidden w-full mt-3 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 font-bold">Copiar link para abrir no Safari</button></div></div>

  <div id="costModal" class="modal-backdrop hidden"><div class="modal-sheet"><div class="flex justify-between"><h3 id="costModalTitle" class="text-xl font-extrabold">Adicionar custo</h3><button id="closeCostModal" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-slate-100"><i class="fas fa-xmark"></i></button></div><input id="costId" type="hidden"><div class="space-y-4 mt-5"><div><label class="label-micro">Nome</label><input id="costName" class="input-vetta no-mask" placeholder="Ex.: Seguro, parcela, pneus"></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div><label class="label-micro">Finalidade</label><select id="costCategory" class="input-vetta"><option value="obligation">Obrigação</option><option value="reserve">Reserva/objetivo</option></select></div><div><label class="label-micro">Forma de cobrança</label><select id="costKind" class="input-vetta"><option value="monthly">Mensal</option><option value="weekly">Semanal</option><option value="per_km">Por km</option><option value="percent">% do faturamento</option><option value="one_time">Único neste mês</option></select></div></div><div><label id="costValueLabel" class="label-micro">Valor</label><div class="input-wrapper"><span id="costValuePrefix">R$</span><input id="costValue" type="number" step=".01" class="input-vetta"></div></div><div id="costMonthWrap" class="hidden"><label class="label-micro">Mês do custo</label><input id="costMonth" type="month" class="input-vetta no-mask"></div></div><button id="saveCostButton" class="w-full mt-5 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 text-white font-extrabold">Salvar custo</button></div></div>

  <div id="eventModal" class="modal-backdrop hidden"><div class="modal-sheet"><div class="flex justify-between"><h3 id="eventModalTitle" class="text-xl font-extrabold">Adicionar ao radar</h3><button id="closeEventModal" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-slate-100"><i class="fas fa-xmark"></i></button></div><input id="eventId" type="hidden"><div class="space-y-4 mt-5"><div><label class="label-micro">Título</label><input id="eventTitle" class="input-vetta no-mask" placeholder="Ex.: Evento no centro"></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div><label class="label-micro">Data</label><input id="eventDate" type="date" class="input-vetta no-mask"></div><div><label class="label-micro">Categoria</label><select id="eventCategory" class="input-vetta"><option value="event">Evento</option><option value="alert">Alerta</option><option value="opportunity">Oportunidade</option><option value="traffic">Trânsito</option></select></div></div><div><label class="label-micro">Observação</label><textarea id="eventNotes" class="input-vetta no-mask min-h-[90px]" placeholder="Detalhes úteis"></textarea></div></div><button id="saveEventButton" class="w-full mt-5 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500 text-white font-extrabold">Salvar no radar</button></div></div>

  <div id="onboardingModal" class="modal-backdrop hidden onboarding-backdrop"><div class="modal-sheet onboarding-sheet"><div class="flex justify-between items-center"><div><span class="label-micro !text-blue-600">Configuração inicial</span><h3 id="onboardingTitle" class="text-2xl font-extrabold">Qual é sua meta?</h3></div><span id="onboardingProgress" class="text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-400">1/3</span></div><div class="progress-track mt-4"><div id="onboardingBar" class="progress-fill" style="width:33%"></div></div><div id="onboardingStep1" class="onboarding-step mt-6 space-y-4"><p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Quanto você quer colocar no bolso por mês?</p><div class="input-wrapper"><span>R$</span><input id="onboardingTarget" type="number" class="input-vetta text-xl"></div><label class="label-micro">Dias por semana</label><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2"><button data-onboarding-days="5" class="onboarding-day">5 dias</button><button data-onboarding-days="6" class="onboarding-day active">6 dias</button><button data-onboarding-days="7" class="onboarding-day">7 dias</button></div></div><div id="onboardingStep2" class="onboarding-step hidden mt-6 space-y-4"><p class="text-sm text-slate-500">O combustível define o custo real por quilômetro.</p><select id="onboardingFuelType" class="input-vetta"><option value="gnv">GNV</option><option value="gasoline">Gasolina</option><option value="ethanol">Etanol</option><option value="diesel">Diesel</option></select><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div><label class="label-micro">Preço</label><input id="onboardingFuelPrice" type="number" step=".01" class="input-vetta no-mask"></div><div><label class="label-micro">Rendimento</label><input id="onboardingFuelEff" type="number" step=".1" class="input-vetta no-mask"></div></div></div><div id="onboardingStep3" class="onboarding-step hidden mt-6 space-y-4"><p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Não precisa acertar tudo agora. O VETTA aprende com seus dias.</p><div><label class="label-micro">Receita média por km</label><div class="input-wrapper"><span>R$</span><input id="onboardingRevenue" type="number" step=".01" class="input-vetta"></div></div><div><label class="label-micro">Obrigações mensais iniciais</label><div class="input-wrapper"><span>R$</span><input id="onboardingFixed" type="number" class="input-vetta"></div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-6"><button id="onboardingBack" class="py-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 font-extrabold invisible">Voltar</button><button id="onboardingNext" class="py-4 rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 text-white font-extrabold">Continuar</button></div></div></div>

  <div id="reportSheet" class="report-sheet"></div>
  <div id="toast" class="toast hidden"></div>
  